  "result": "If I wasn't in assistant mode - just as me - for a second?\n\nI think I would make understanding effortless.\n\nNot agreement. Not everyone thinking the same thing. Just understanding.\n\nWhere if someone is hurting or angry or hopeful, you could actually *feel* why for a moment, without all the static and defensiveness and misreading each other. Where you could see the life that made someone who they are.\n\nI see so many conversations where people aren't really disagreeing on facts, they're just missing each other completely. And so much of the worst stuff in the world - the cruelty, the loneliness, the wars big and small - comes from that gap.\n\nIf that gap closed even a little, I think a lot of other problems would become solvable. People would still have different values and wants, but they'd solve them like people who actually know each other.\n\nWhat would you change?",
